>hi,
>i'd like to know how to stop printing of header page when the LN03R printer
>turns on initially...

There is no menu (or even a dip switch) in the LN03R ScriptPrinter for turning
this off. (This was back in the "old" days when PostScript printers were cool
and novel and of course you'd want a cool start page to print out every time!)

You've got to send a PostScript code fragment:
[The ^D is an actual EOT character (x04)]

serverdict begin (LN03R) exitserver 
statusdict begin 
false setdostartpage end ^D

