>Many thanks for your reply. I succeeded to set up a LAT service on one port,
>but I found a serious problem. Downloads are going with maximum speed, but
>uploads are only at 10% of this maximum value
>Tested 2 modems, one with 9600 Baud (1045 cps download speed) and a
>14400 Baud (1648 cps).
