I can't help you with your exact question, but can suggest an
alternative.  Build and link your product against the UCX libraries,
and rely on TGV Multinet's UCX emulation to make it work on target
systems that have Multinet installed.  That way, your product will
work on systems with EITHER software installed.
Of course, you'd want to test the built product on a system running
only Multinet to make sure the emulation does what you want.
My experience is that it's pretty good.



