>Hi, this is probably a dumb question, but how do I change the
>..> key so that it gives a > in "upper case".
>
>I know I can pull down the keyboard option and click on
>"Comma key sends .<", but this only works for that windown.
>Every time I open a new window I have to do it again.

Do the above and then "Save settings".  It will create a
DECW$TERMINAL_DEFAULTS.DAT file which will get used for all future
DECterms.  You may want to edit that file and remove the lines which define
the title and icon names as these will be as they were in the window from
which you did the save.

You can't program F1, but F11 is treated as ESC by DECterm.

