For Jensen (AlphaPC w/EISA bus) and Noname (AlphaPC w/PCI bus), there
are also native drivers for the keyboard, console, floppy, and SCSI
(for Jensen only) and possibly others by now.  However, notice that
the first (v0.1.0) is not self-hosting yet. To quote from the README
