>
>#!/usr/bin/ksh
>#
># Startup the X server.  In the case of a DECstation 5000/133 this is Xws.
>#
># This file sets the font path to the DECwindow 100dpi directory plus
># the directory containing miscellaneous fonts and the MIT supplied fonts.
>#
