>seven years ago, but seems to fail now. Since I don't have access
>to the required OpenVMS docs, could some kind sole help me out....


	This works for me:

        include '($syidef)'
        include '($jpidef)'
..
        call lib$getjpi(jpi$_cputim,,,j)

(j is integer*4 by default; lib$getjpi returns elapsed cpu time in 100ths of
a second in j; the include of '($syidef)' is probably for other bits in my
code but I put it here just in case).

	There used to be VMS help available on WWW, but last time I saw a
reference to it it said "this doesn't work any more"; anyone know any pointers
to such a facility?

