Packview
A Remote Network Monitoring Software Solution

DDIX Inc. announces Packview, a distributed network monitoring software
solution for SunOS and DEC Ultrix.

    Packview is a distributed network monitoring software solution
    for SunOS and DEC Ultrix.  It is an easy to use software based
    network monitoring tool that features a Motif graphical user
    interface.  Packview's advanced statistical analysis features
    allow you to see network traffic patterns and trends in a graphical
    form.  You can monitor local and remote networks from one or more 
    network management workstations.  No more lugging around 
    expensive and hardware based network analyzers!  

    The Packview analysis tool consists of two components.  The first
    component is the Packview probe which collects raw network statistics.
    The second component is the Packview client, which is an easy to use
    network monitoring tool featuring a Motif graphical user interface.
    Collectively, the two components provide a powerful tool for managing
    networks from a central management workstation.  A Toolkit is also 
    provided to add on additional protocol support.  Packview can augment 
