We just got a bunch of Alphas and had to figure out the same thing.
Look in the little wirebound book "ZLXp-E1/E2/E3 PCI Graphics Options
Owner's Guide" -- all you have to do is set some switches that are
accessible through a slot in back of the CPU, and reboot.  See page 7.
