>Hi Brian,

Hello...

>Do you know if there is a chip that will do the opposite:
>i.e. RED   }
>     BLUE  }           }RED
>     GREEN }  LM?????  }BLUE
>     HSYNC }           }GREEN (+vsync+hsync)
